X:02
T:High Way to Dublin. TCo.02, The
B:Rev T. Cowper MS, 1766, Westmoreland
Z:Village Music Project 2016 Hugh Taylor
N:There is an unrelated jig, in the nearby Harrison MS and elsewhere, called The Highway to Dublin
N:There is no time signature written.
N:As I have not been able to find it elsewhere I have attempted a reconstruction.
N:This involved simply rebarring, beaming for clarity, and removing the awkward extra crotchet at the end of each phrase.
